{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntityEvent"},"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"type":"inheritsFrom","kind":"relationships","title":"Inherits From","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntityEvent\/propagates"],"title":"Type Properties","anchor":"Type-Properties"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Trigger"],"title":"Reacting to Changes with Hooks and Observers","anchor":"Reacting-to-Changes-with-Hooks-and-Observers"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type that describes something that happens to a particular entity, which its observers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"respond to at once."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntityEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Observers.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Observers.swift#L58"},"externalID":"s:11WorldModule11EntityEventP","roleHeading":"Protocol","title":"EntityEvent","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"EntityEvent"}],"symbolKind":"protocol"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/entityevent"]}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EntityEvent"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Sendable","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use an entity event when one part of a program needs to tell an entity that something"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"happened to it, and other parts need to respond right away: a barrel is hit, a button is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"clicked. Declare the event as a type that conforms to "},{"code":"EntityEvent","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", register observers with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/observe(_:on:perform:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/observe(_:perform:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", and trigger it with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/trigger(_:on:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":". The observers run before "},{"code":"trigger(_:on:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" returns."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example despawns a barrel when it explodes:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct Explode: EntityEvent { var radius: Double }","","var world = World()","let barrel = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Barrel\"))","world.observe(Explode.self, on: barrel) { world, trigger in","    world.despawn(trigger.entity)","}","","world.trigger(Explode(radius: 3), on: barrel)","print(world.contains(barrel))","\/\/ Prints \"false\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An entity event differs from an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Event","type":"reference"},{"text":", which waits in a queue until systems read it.","type":"text"}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Propagating Up the Hierarchy","anchor":"Propagating-Up-the-Hierarchy"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An event whose ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntityEvent\/propagates","type":"reference"},{"text":" property is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" moves on to the entity’s parent","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf","type":"reference"},{"text":") after the entity’s observers run, then to that entity’s parent, and so on up to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the root. The following example lets a panel respond to clicks on any of its buttons:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct Clicked: EntityEvent {","    static var propagates: Bool { true }","}","struct ClickLog: Resource { var entries: [String] = [] }","","var world = World()","world.resources.insert(ClickLog())","let panel = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Panel\"))","let button = world.spawn(Name(value: \"OK\"))","try world.addChild(button, to: panel)","","world.observe(Clicked.self, on: panel) { world, trigger in","    let name = world[Name.self, of: trigger.originalEntity].value","    world.resources[ClickLog.self].entries.append(\"Panel saw a click on \\(name)\")","}","","world.trigger(Clicked(), on: button)","print(world.resources[ClickLog.self].entries)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"Panel saw a click on OK\"]\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An observer can stop an event from going further by setting the trigger’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Trigger\/propagates","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" property to ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Trigger/entity":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The entity whose observers are running: the entity the event was triggered on, or an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ancestor it propagated to."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"entity","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Trigger\/entity","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"entity","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/trigger\/entity"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Trigger":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The event an observer receives, with the entity it’s being observed on and the entity it was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"triggered on."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Trigger","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/trigger","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Trigger","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Trigger","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Trigger"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/trigger(_:on:)":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Triggers an event on an entity, running its observers before returning.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/trigger(_:on:)","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/trigger(_:on:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"trigger","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"E","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externa